{"updated":"2026-11-15T23:17:39.798Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"Dft-ss9EwuY","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dft-ss9EwuY","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"Gemini最近出了多款新模型\n一分鐘帶你了解\n#AI","timestamp":"2026-11-14T10:22:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DftIxBkgKxL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DftIxBkgKxL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"用Fable做的影片","timestamp":"2026-11-14T02:30:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfq_yD8k8SC","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_yD8k8SC","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"我把新北歡樂耶誕城搬進瀏覽器了，還能揪朋友一起逛。🎄\n輸入暱稱、分享房間連結，大家就會出現在同一座 3D 耶誕城。\n每間房間最多 40 人，也能用私人房間代碼約朋友集合。\n一起逛市民廣場、板橋車站、萬坪公園等燈區 \n邊走邊聊天，揮手、比愛心、跳舞、擺 Pose\n按下拍照，全房間收到 3 秒倒數提示\n合照能套耶誕框或拍立得，下載留念\n走到捷運站搭車，前往淡水、新莊等響應燈區","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfq_x9pkye5","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq_x9pkye5","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"線上一起逛\nntpc-christmasland-3d.malilion.workers.d…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T06:33:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfq79LyE1LH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79LyE1LH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"13 張 AI 圖，約 1.3 美元的生圖成本。 \n作者把它們做成了一套 3D 萬聖節村莊素材。\n 📦 更有趣的是，每個模型還能從一張平面紙，慢慢「折」成立體。\n這個開源 Claude Code Skill 叫 Origami-3Dfolder-ai，走的是一套數位摺紙流程： 幾何形狀 → UV 展開圖 → AI 上色 → Blender 折回 3D\n－製作木箱、桌子、攤位、樹木等低多邊形道具 －輸出帶貼圖的 GLB，接進 Three.js \n－附上 Fold 動畫，讓素材自己折出來\n－已有符合格式的紙模型圖樣，也能跳過 AI 上色 作者示範用 12 種資產，在場景裡擺放 75 次，再讓物件沿著道路依序折起來，組成一座萬聖節村莊。 \n目前以簡單形狀為主，需要 Blender 4.x；AI 上色需付費 API。 1.3 美元是作者的示範成本，場景編排工具則不包含在 repo。","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:55.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfq79C-k4JH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/Dfq79C-k4JH","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/lejri…","timestamp":"2026-11-13T05:59:54.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"Dfw8jbNidB3","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfw8jbNidB3","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"你覺得有準嗎><? 原文來自✨不要惹雙魚座✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-15T14:00:35.000Z","stats":{"likes":10,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":3},"score":13,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfw8iSBiRG2","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfw8iSBiRG2","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"雙魚座難搞起來真的很～難～～搞？？？？\n\n雙魚座現實起來比魔羯還冷漠\n內心新奇古怪的想法可比水瓶還多\n沒理智後的衝動比牡羊還火爆\n脾氣牛起來比金牛還要牛\n翻臉像翻書比雙子還快\n殼硬起來比巨蟹還硬\n死要面子連獅子都要畏懼三分\n在奇怪的點龜毛起來連處女都會怕\n若猶豫不決甚至比天秤還躊躇\n記恨玩手段起來心機比天蠍可怕\n不安全感讓雙魚比射手還花心","timestamp":"2026-11-15T14:00:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":495,"replies":23,"reposts":43,"shares":168},"score":670,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwuxLLEx2E","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfwuxLLEx2E","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"原文來自✨室友把我的胰妥讚拿出冰箱 快氣死==✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:00:08.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwuwJakxkW","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfwuwJakxkW","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"想問大家遇到這種室友會怎麼處理🙂\n\n昨天原po回家打開冰箱發現胰妥讚不見了（未開封）\n找了半天才發現被室友拿出來放在流理台上\n問他為什麼要動我的東西\n結果他說因為買太多冰箱放不下\n想說我的東西那麼小一盒 拿出來先放旁邊應該沒差\n然後他就忘記了......\n重點是他不知道胰妥讚有保存溫度的限制\n就這樣直接放在室溫好幾個小時==\n我跟他說這個藥很難拿 不是隨便放都沒關係\n他居然回啊你又沒寫不能拿出來？？？","timestamp":"2026-11-15T11:59:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":14,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfwn7Tej_o7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfwn7Tej_o7","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"對方忽冷忽熱好難捉摸><？原文來自✨射手男在意你會說以下這樣嗎？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多星座的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-15T11:00:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":5,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfwn57ejxgT","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/Dfwn57ejxgT","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"求解！射手男在意你會說這些話嗎？\n\n1.我有空一定第一時間回覆妳的訊息\n放心～不用想太多\n2.有問題也一定會馬上跟妳反應 不要擔心\n3.如果我們同居 我每天都能抱著你睡 哈哈哈\n（因為我前面有說：你不在旁邊怎麼睡得好🫣）","timestamp":"2026-11-15T11:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":14,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":16,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ithome","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@cool3c","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kocpc","posts":[{"id":"Dfwy96PlDJ4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfwy96PlDJ4","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:36:49.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfwy8cBFDsQ","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfwy8cBFDsQ","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"AI代理卡關時，先別急著照抄Prompt。AgentUseCases.ai整理逾2,000筆使用者案例，可按工具與任務找靈感；先看原始來源、限制，再改成自己的流程。分享不等於逐項實測保證，怎麼判斷哪些用法適合自己？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-15T12:36:37.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwJdMylH4G","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfwJdMylH4G","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-15T06:34:05.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwJcs9lDHA","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfwJcs9lDHA","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"《GTA5》不只拿來飆車，研究團隊把固定式自行車接上遊戲，在虛擬車流裡測試震動把手與警示背心。先讓志願者在模擬環境遇上危險，再觀察反應；目前仍屬研究，裝置尚未量產。遊戲還能怎麼幫忙道安？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-15T06:34:01.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":5,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwEdqbijP0","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfwEdqbijP0","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"這種事情在貓貓上基本不可能，還是狗狗熱情","timestamp":"2026-11-15T05:51:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":82,"replies":5,"reposts":1,"shares":33},"score":95,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"Dfv99H6Cr5P","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/Dfv99H6Cr5P","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"人類航天歷史的一刻，SpaceX完成筷子夾火箭回收，一級如果沒濺落就完美了","timestamp":"2026-11-15T04:54:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":29,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":4},"score":29,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[{"id":"DfudzsdkrKO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfudzsdkrKO","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"身旁很多人跟我一樣，過去都是政治冷感，覺得誰做都差不多，但這次已經太多跡象跟你說鄰居就是要把你吃了，不知道什麼原因國民黨各種大佬演都不演了，直接跟你說台灣人就是中國人…\n\n國民黨也公布一國兩制十年計畫：\n\n2027 年：藍白陣營在立法院推動兩岸共同市場談判\n2028 年：國民黨執政，兩岸互設代表機構\n2030 年：與中國建立共同市場\n2032 年：統一貨幣 \n2036 年：開始討論一國兩制\n\n還有很多人在說民進黨帶風向那麼多年了，哪一年這的統一了？\n\n請想想你們的兒子女兒，還有可愛的小孫子小孫女，如果以後沒有票可以投，不能發表反對的意見，滑社群平台看Youtube要翻牆的日子，是你們想要的嗎？看看台灣的經濟發展，再看看對面的發展，真的是你們想要的嗎？","timestamp":"2026-11-14T14:53:26.000Z","stats":{"likes":136,"replies":17,"reposts":11,"shares":4},"score":203,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfrasiTkjYE","url":"https://www.threads.com/@ai.lanrenbao/post/DfrasiTkjYE","username":"ai.lanrenbao","displayName":"ai.lanrenbao","content":"最近收到一間倫敦機器人公司的 Offer 了！！！\n\n去年辭職後跑到英國，唸 Robotics MSc，覺得真的太水了我到底幹嘛來浪費錢，根本沒辦法讓我進機器人公司。\n\n後來決定好好來做 AI 導入，目標FDE，在倫敦有很多缺，砍了自己的價接了很多案子，希望有更多應用 AI 的機會，同時好好優化懶人報的系統。\n\n畢業後面試了一輪FDE，還算拿得到面試，但基本上都第一關就沒有下文了...\n超級挫折，回到在美國剛畢業時的沒自信、徬徨，覺得自己不如 AI 的低谷，覺得都三十幾歲了又剛畢業，是不是該先求有工作就好。\n\n剛好看到有這個機器人公司的 Software QA 缺，面試時也發現他們要找的是可以把 Test Infra 從零建起來，還希望對建置AI Workflow有經驗，還那麼剛好我又唸Robotics，根本是個超Strong Match。\n\n果然，真的不會有白走的路啊~!!!\n有太多心得想跟大家分享了，最近再來好好聊聊～\n\n祝看到這篇文在找工作的人，三個月內都會順利上岸🍀","timestamp":"2026-11-13T10:28:32.000Z","stats":{"likes":980,"replies":62,"reposts":6,"shares":34},"score":1122,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfxIIodnycm","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfxIIodnycm","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"請問如果想讓 AI 變聰明\n也是拜文昌帝君嗎？\n\n還是羅技可以考慮跟文昌帝君聯名出個鍵盤\n上面要有這些按鈕","timestamp":"2026-11-15T15:41:47.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwZCDxH6vH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfwZCDxH6vH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"感謝 @bogi_we_ai 舉辦第二屆末日議會\n\n活動超多人，遇到非常多熟面孔\n@ironv.careerlife @cab_late @lupus_rr @tbr.digital @leevent_0414\n\n還有很多熟悉的網友見面會，甚至有國外期間限定\n或是有幸新認識的朋友\n@helloivan.tech @ai.lanrenbao @dawson54068 @jimmytalks.ai @vickytsai927 @symphonicrain1124 @techtip_s.scarlett_\n\n現場除了有很多大家可以深思熟慮的 AI 議題\n大型網友見面會也能面對面的跟追蹤或崇拜很久的大大們聊天\n也會有不少人分享自己目前做出來的產品或是專案\n\n離場前還剛好看到蠻美的夕陽","timestamp":"2026-11-15T08:50:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":29,"replies":15,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":59,"first_seen":"2026-11-16T01:36:05+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfwXuhtn5n4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfwXuhtn5n4","user